<view class="chat-page"><app-header title="{{agentLabel}}专项规划" eyebrow="{{stage === 'report' ? '报告已生成' : '规划对话'}}" back bind:back="back"/><view class="progress"><view class="progress__fill" style="width: {{progress}}%"></view></view><state-view wx:if="{{error && !messages.length}}" state="error" title="规划会话暂不可用" message="{{error}}" bind:action="retry"/><scroll-view wx:else class="messages" scroll-y enhanced scroll-into-view="{{scrollId}}"><view class="messages__inner"><stream-message wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id" id="{{item.id}}" role="{{item.role}}" content="{{item.content}}" streaming="{{item.streaming}}"/><question-card wx:if="{{question}}" question="{{question}}" disabled="{{sending}}" bind:answer="answer"/><view wx:if="{{awaitingAnalysis}}" class="analysis-actions"><text>确认分析方向后生成完整报告，或先补充修正。</text><button disabled="{{sending}}" bindtap="approveAnalysis">确认并生成路线</button><button disabled="{{sending}}" bindtap="correctAnalysis">补充修正</button></view><text wx:if="{{sending}}" class="thinking">正在更新规划上下文…</text></view></scroll-view><view class="composer"><textarea class="composer__input" value="{{input}}" bindinput="input" auto-height maxlength="2000" placeholder="{{awaitingAnalysis ? '输入需要修正的方向' : '回答问题或补充你的情况'}}" disabled="{{sending}}"/><button class="composer__send" disabled="{{sending || !input}}" bindtap="send">发送</button></view></view>
